## Original Content
Leonardo Maria Del Vecchio, um dos filhos do fundador da Luxottica, é presidente da Ray Ban e CSO do grupo

## Summary
Leonardo Maria Del Vecchio, a son of Luxottica's founder, is leaving Ray-Ban amid a family dispute. He holds the positions of president at Ray-Ban and CSO of the Luxottica group. This highlights internal conflicts within the luxury eyewear company.

